[[12195,4718,"Communication/transfer of care/handover between social services, the first placement and/or the final placement was insufficient, given the complexities of the deceased's case","insufficient communication/transfer of care",""],[12196,4718,"The process of assessment of care needs prior to admission was inadequate","inadequate assessment of care needs",""],[12197,4718,"Medicine Policy &/or ii)Medicine administration training, supervision and audit processes at Persona were inadequate and unsafe (indeed, the audit process was perfunctory","inadequate medicine policy and training",""],[12198,4718,"Staff were unable to recognise the deteriorating adult and did not seek medical attention in a timely manner when signs of change became apparent","failure to recognise deterioration and seek timely medical attention",""],[12199,4718,"Record keeping was inadequate and in parts, incomplete","inadequate record keeping",""],[12200,4718,"There is no policy/protocol for the observation/monitoring of service users e.g. when directed to do so by a medical practitioner","absence of observation/monitoring policy",""]]